### Create task 1
POST {{host}}/api/task
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

{
  "name": "{{user_task1_name}}",
  "projectID": "{{user_project1_id}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("user_task1_name", response.body.data.name);
    client.global.set("user_task1_id", response.body.data.id);
%}

### Update task 1
PATCH {{host}}/api/task
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

{
  "id": "{{user_task1_id}}",
  "name": "User1 task1 RENAMED",
  "projectID": "{{user_project1_id}}"
}

### Get task 1
GET {{host}}/api/task/{{user_task1_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}


