### Start task 3
PATCH {{host}}/api/task/{{user_task3_id}}/start
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}
X-Timezone: Europe/Prague

### Get task 3
GET {{host}}/api/task/{{user_task3_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

### Stop task 3
PATCH {{host}}/api/task/{{user_task3_id}}/stop
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

### Get task 1
GET {{host}}/api/task/{{user_task3_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

### Close task 3
PATCH {{host}}/api/task/{{user_task3_id}}/close
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

### Get task 1
GET {{host}}/api/task/{{user_task3_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

### List project tasks
GET {{host}}/api/task/list/project/{{user_project1_id}}?isActive=1&limit=2&offset=0
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}
